{"about":["After centuries spent slumbering in the bowels of the earth, the primordial beasts known as Titans have awoken. Now they must battle humanity - and one another - for total world dominance.","GigaBash combines the chaos and creativity of titles like Power Stone, Super Smash Bros and War of Monsters with the jaw-dropping scale of the classic kaiju movies. Play as either a rampaging Titan or a Titan-hunting mecha; summon lightning from the heavens, use a radio tower as a baton, or roll a whole district (and your enemies) into a single massive snowball. Wreak enough havoc and you'll evolve into your final form, the terrifyingly titanic S-Class."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202206/1018/FXjNuoxfbELnuhwEM8TLDSUm.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202206/1018/FXjNuoxfbELnuhwEM8TLDSUm.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202208/0410/J7KvbzcngXeihYRYEqE4SU6q.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202208/0410/J7KvbzcngXeihYRYEqE4SU6q.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202208/0410/K5fuz9ZhWkvAgQ5ArnufNwY9.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202208/0410/K5fuz9ZhWkvAgQ5ArnufNwY9.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202206/1018/QKVQtP5xaOKSIomWHVBNRRtM.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202206/1018/QKVQtP5xaOKSIomWHVBNRRtM.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202208/0410/tFmncKa62bP4ZinJmXYR4021.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202208/0410/tFmncKa62bP4ZinJmXYR4021.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202206/1018/30uBoOJiCUFsdR6LfXxARMHV.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstatio